    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00982",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "库拉巴喀那双眯缝眼儿迸发出光彩。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A gleam flashed in Kuraback's narrow eyes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00982",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他跟马咯握了一下手，突然直奔门口。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He shook Magura's hand, then suddenly rushed straight toward the doorway.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00982",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "不用多说，这会儿左邻右舍一大群河童都聚集在托喀家的门口围观，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Needless to say, by then a large crowd of kappa from the neighborhood had gathered at the door of Tokka's house to watch,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00982",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "好奇地朝房间里张望。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "peering curiously into the room.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00982",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "库拉巴喀胡乱把人群扒拉到两边，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Kuraback roughly shoved the crowd aside,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00982",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "随即跳上了汽车。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "then immediately jumped into the car.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00982",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "汽车马达轰隆，转瞬消失了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The car's engine roared, and in an instant it vanished.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
